[info] i  You are about to deploy [2b4dfd9]: Home: tidy the Most popular card

Move the badge inside the card (top-right, within the padding) so it no longer
juts past the border, give both path cards equal height (h-full) and pin both
CTAs to the bottom (mt-auto) so 'Book a night' and 'Book a night or an entire
week' line up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com> 
[info] i  You may also track this rollout at:
	https://console.firebase.google.com/project/scopebnb/apphosting 
