mart Buttons + Orders v2 capture at booking time; server routes\n  create/capture and confirm the booking on a verified capture.\n- 10-minute cinema-style hold with a live countdown; availability releases an\n  unpaid request after the window (paid bookings always block).\n- When payments are off (no client id), checkout falls back to\n  \"request → admin confirms\".\n- Remote guide PDF download once a remote booking is paid.\n\nAdmin:\n- Test orders (isTest) + delete + multi-select bulk actions; test orders\n  excluded from stats, occupancy and availability.\n- Customers view (fichas by email); PayPal fee + net captured and shown; net\n  revenue in the overview; paid counts as realized.\n- Occupancy spans multi-night stays, shows $ on sold days, joins a sale's days\n  into one bar, and names the customer in the tooltip.\n\nFirestore rules: bookings are create/read-only for clients; updates/deletes go\nthrough the Admin SDK so payment/status can't be forged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/d5f9981fc4e43854e4a542ffc6e218798a189329","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com","imageUri":"https://github.com/portegno.png"},"commitTime":"2026-09-09T21:03:50Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/4e3917ee-80ce-41d3-92ca-2944777ace71?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-09-09T21:04:15.240112057Z","updateTime":"2026-09-09T21:04:55.746700Z","displayName":"build-2026-09-09-010","uid":"acc6e21a-6475-494b-9abe-dd5f63a94c65","etag":"qdz6MUt6uxb__PCmWLlFdPeMxTiYSSI0Vm9YHdBTcBA","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":9,"message":"Your apphosting.yaml file at path '/workspace/apphosting.yaml' is not formatted properly. Please see https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#apphosting-yaml for guidance on how to format your apphosting.yaml file.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis