ght → confirm; managed keeps the\ntarget/framing flow. Supports /book?mode=managed|remote deep-links and a\ndynamic step tracker.\n\nMerge the two product pages into /how-it-works (showcase + full specs +\nanchored per-modality sections with deep-link CTAs) and delete /imaging,\n/remote-control and /remote-control/book. Simplify nav (How it works ·\nPricing · FAQ) and footer; repoint all CTAs. Card now accepts an optional id.\n\nFramer: replace the mosaic <select> with a prominent toggle button that\nreveals soft segmented grid options (2×1 / 1×2 / 2×2). Opening defaults to\na real 2×1 mosaic; closing reverts to a single frame. Modern minimal styling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/1ba182c94605693468c94895e5e9903a87ef62cf","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-06T12:34:09Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/86cd7e61-9d9f-42eb-9413-22bdee3139f5?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-06-08T12:35:05.253263847Z","updateTime":"2026-06-08T12:37:37.933058Z","uid":"58f345b6-5094-4bc5-8f8b-8b5dd9b021fb","etag":"ruFcXpO12HKw8HmSzw6CkQdxCK1DtVUR1TvFa6a4juQ","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-06-08-003","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":9,"message":"Your secret 'GEMINI_API_KEY@latest' is not formatted properly. Please see https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for guidance on how to format your secret.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason":"fah/improper-secret-format","metadata":{"attribution":"USER","user_facing_reason":"Improper Secret Format","user_facing_message":"Your secret 'GEMINI_API_KEY@latest' is not formatted properly. Please see https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for guidance on how to format your secret."}}