"2e9d48b6e36bbf228bb49c3220784db3898bc4e5","commitMessage":"Add admin dashboard: orders, RBAC, occupancy & night blocking\n\n- Admin app at /admin (light dashboard, own shell) split from the public\n  (site) route group; served via Firebase Admin SDK (ADC) behind /api/admin/*.\n- Orders management: list/filter/search, status workflow, claim, review.\n- RBAC: granular permissions assigned per admin user (Firestore), super\n  admins via SUPER_ADMIN_EMAILS; customer contact & revenue redacted\n  server-side for users without the permission.\n- Overview metrics with date range + month occupancy strip: night-tier\n  border, sold/blocked %, month navigation + picker, and night blocking\n  (block mode, shared note, public /api/availability feeds the booking\n  calendar with real bookings + blocks).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/2e9d48b6e36bbf228bb49c3220784db3898bc4e5","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com","imageUri":"https://github.com/portegno.png"},"commitTime":"2026-06-09T01:37:08Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/76a82f19-5e42-44a8-b2ca-baa922b4e5e6?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-06-09T01:37:11.690939264Z","updateTime":"2026-06-09T01:39:23.189129Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-09-001","uid":"4cfe5bae-39da-45da-a5d4-9e7a54619458","etag":"keK3ljmI5ttVkjSNRIbmGM4VDp_0rDl8U_w-So492zI","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-06-09-002","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":9,"message":"Your application failed to run the framework build command 'npm exec --prefix /layers/google.nodejs.firebasenextjs/npm_modules apphosting-adapter-nextjs-build' successfully. Please check the raw log to address the error and confirm that your application builds locally before redeploying.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason"