he same craft for\nevery business: the 600px table, the hidden preview text, Outlook obeying the\nattribute and not the CSS, two columns that must stack on a phone. None of that\nis ScopeBnB's. It lived here by accident, because ScopeBnB already had a\nnewsletter panel when the team learned to write editions.\n\nNow an edition arrives as a whole document, built by Portegno with MJML and\nskinned with the brand the business declares. Wrapping it again would nest a\nfull `<html>` inside another, which some clients render and others silently\ndrop.\n\nWhat stays on this side is what is actually ours: the sending account, the\ndomain whose reputation gets burned if an edition is bad, the subscriber list,\nand how this provider spells an unsubscribe link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/3d2a93a12c978bef405e0fe1a86db7298de0078c","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com","imageUri":"https://github.com/portegno.png"},"commitTime":"2026-09-06T19:34:48Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b53c0caf-714a-4c5e-bfa2-2a91681c9fb6?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-09-06T19:34:53.379687210Z","updateTime":"2026-09-06T19:37:45.454524Z","displayName":"build-2026-09-06-011","uid":"21c3208a-a58f-4b27-8184-39fa829f3fa2","etag":"qgI0FxRiMCi0MBKvxaBaOPYy077tga01EgjTvYOnXeg","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-09-06-010","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/scopebnb/firebaseapphosting-images/scopebnb:build-2026-09-06-010","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyB2_bWFjvM3eBrOCdmINRONo8fNNt4leh0","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"scopebnb.firebaseapp.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME