t into the shared editor, so\nthey went into the blog too. That is a regression, and a quiet one: from now on\nanything pasted into a post would keep its inline styles, which is exactly what\nthe blog does not want.\n\nA post and an email are opposite artifacts. A post is semantic HTML inside a page\nthat owns its CSS -- `<h2>`, `<p>`, `<figure>` and nothing else -- and that is\nwhat lets the site be restyled without rewriting every post. An email is tables\nand inline styles because mail clients ignore stylesheets.\n\nSo `paraMail` is off by default and the newsletter is the only caller that turns\nit on. Same component, two schemas, instead of one schema pretending to be both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/8f46fa9636b485d381b7c1e920d2fa312f05e108","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com","imageUri":"https://github.com/portegno.png"},"commitTime":"2026-09-06T19:22:04Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/7cc5010d-2bdc-42b4-b17d-08b949abfbff?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-09-06T19:22:10.246682140Z","updateTime":"2026-09-06T19:24:52.066663Z","displayName":"build-2026-09-06-010","uid":"9d32f455-1346-4417-a4ee-e57c52daa5eb","etag":"i6CtSsNOr2a1DYVtVVUUGjSbvOBbqBCkwRkI-kLvLNA","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-09-06-013","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/scopebnb/firebaseapphosting-images/scopebnb:build-2026-09-06-013","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyB2_bWFjvM3eBrOCdmINRONo8fNNt4leh0","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"scopebnb.firebaseapp.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"scopebnb","ava