0980a8846aa8708996628edcea86df","commitMessage":"Ask design for a change, right under the preview\n\nBelow the preview, because that is where you are looking when you notice what\nyou want changed. You type it, design applies it, and the edition above comes\nback changed with a line saying what was done.\n\nThe request is written on the draft and not sent anywhere. The panel lives on\nthe business side and cannot -- and should not -- write into Portegno's\ndatabase: that would be handing a product the key to the house. But the\nbusiness's own database is already a door the worker reads and writes, so a\n`pedido` field means \"someone has to do something here\", the same way `esperando\nfirma` means it inside a run. No new auth, no new plumbing, and the right\ndirection: whoever asks leaves it where whoever works already looks.\n\nA second ask replaces the first. Two pending requests on one edition is a way to\nget half of each.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/5c56fb8fc90980a8846aa8708996628edcea86df","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com","imageUri":"https://github.com/portegno.png"},"commitTime":"2026-09-06T19:50:37Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/3d49ed8e-7cc3-4763-9636-8da378f143a4?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-09-06T19:50:40.495267304Z","updateTime":"2026-09-06T19:53:32.567895Z","displayName":"build-2026-09-06-012","uid":"d8190f52-ea4e-4e8f-8a54-436ea39ce44a","etag":"28CxQQMYkHq4y4q1jzSy0ziz6IaG5bBOulIQlWx9WBE","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-06-15-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/scopebnb/firebaseapphosting-images/scopebnb:build-2026-06-15-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyB2_b