e":"{\"apiKey\":\"AIzaSyB2_bWFjvM3eBrOCdmINRONo8fNNt4leh0\",\"appId\":\"1:545100308806:web:53f12e90e180139c470547\",\"authDomain\":\"scopebnb.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"545100308806\",\"projectId\":\"scopebnb\",\"storageBucket\":\"scopebnb.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS","value":"X-Forwarded-Host","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_ALLOWED_HOSTS","value":"scopebnb-545100308806.us-central1.run.app,scopebnb-ew6odra35q-uc.a.run.app,t-3877127783---scopebnb-ew6odra35q-uc.a.run.app,scopebnb--scopebnb.us-central1.hosted.app,scopebnb.com,www.scopebnb.com","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"commit":"00eb2e465b052e5e61bd8dcb5e1ff42176d9b898","displayName":"00eb2e465b052e5e61bd8dcb5e1ff42176d9b898","hash":"00eb2e465b052e5e61bd8dcb5e1ff42176d9b898","commitMessage":"Newsletter, scheduled blog publishing, and blog image lightbox\n\nNewsletter:\n- Subscription box (full + compact variants) on home, pricing and booking,\n  offering 10% off the first session; email stored in Firestore.\n- Transactional welcome email with the discount code via Resend, mirrored\n  into the Resend audience on signup.\n- Admin /admin/newsletter (new permission newsletter.manage): compose with\n  the blog editor, send a test, or send a Broadcast to the audience; sent\n  campaigns are recorded in Firestore history.\n- Resend wiring in apphosting.yaml (RESEND_API_KEY secret, NEWSLETTER_FROM,\n  RESEND_AUDIENCE_ID) and firestore.rules deny for the new collections.\n\nScheduled blog publishing (no scheduler):\n- A future publishedAt schedules a post; listPublished/getPublishedBySlug\n  filter publishedAt <= now in memory, so it appears on its own.\n- PostEditor date/time picker with a Schedule action; admin list marks\n  \"Scheduled\".\n\nBlog image lightbox:\n- Click any post image (or the cover) to view it full-screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/portegno/scopebnb/commit/00eb2e465b052e5e61bd8dcb5e1ff42176d9b898","author":{"displayName":"portegno","email":"gabriel@portegno.com"},"commitTime":"2026-09-01T02:05:04Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/fdc54885-82b4-4fef-81c8-1cb1238cf7aa?project=545100308806","createTime":"2026-09-01T02:06:05.175214404Z","updateTime":"2026-09-01T02:08:27.487189Z","labels":{"deployment-tool":"cli-firebase"},"uid":"54bb92be-37ce-451b-8f77-1bcd2ab7a6be","etag":"Of2udp5WwnvooRcBXgZQwHezd0uPxftDbF6Eym2o1vU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/scopebnb/locations/us-central1/backends/scopebnb/builds/build-2026-06-12-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/scopebnb/firebaseapphosting-images/scopebnb:build-2026-06-12-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyB2_bWFjvM3eBrOCdmINRONo8fNNt4leh0","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"scopebnb.firebaseapp.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"scopebnb","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"scopebnb.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"545100308806","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID","value":"1:545100308806:web:49692d66e4a1be12470547","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"GEMINI_MODEL","value":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"GEMINI_API_KEY","secret":"projects/545100308806/secrets/GEMINI_API_KEY/versions/1","availability":["RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"SUPER_ADMIN_EMAILS","value":"gabriel@pulpou.com","availability":["RUNTIME"]},{"var